<title>USA: VWR Scientific Products Q4 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>VWR Scientific Products Q4 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, PA. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.09	     loss $0.03</p>
<p> Net loss	  2,100	     loss 700</p>
<p> Revs		272,600		  256,500</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.32		    $0. 13</p>
<p> Net		 7,000		    1,900</p>
<p> Revs		1,100,000		718,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 was the company's first full year of combined operations since the acquisition of the Baxter Industrial Distribution Business in late 1995.</p>
<p>Pretax acquisition-related charges totaled $5.1 million in 1996 and $3.8 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Pretax acquisition-related charges totaled $1.0 million in Q4 1996 and $1.7 million in Q4 1995.</p>
</text>
